n, even though he’s a terrible pirate, far outclassed by rivals voiced by Jeremy Piven and Salma Hayek.", "reference": "2012 April 26, Tasha Robinson, “Film: Reviews: The Pirates! Band Of Misfits :”, in The Onion AV Club:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": []}], "source": {"url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/voice", "license": {"name": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}}}}